msgstr "Fourniture (en pause)"

#. Shown when the post-checkout confirmation poll gives up (2 minutes) without the server confirming the subscription. The purchase is still likely to land later; the background poll and the next launch pick it up. On apple: the delayed phase of PurchaseSuccessView and the MainView snackbar.
msgctxt "purchase_confirmation_timeout"
msgid "We couldn't confirm your purchase yet. If you completed checkout, your plan will update automatically in a few minutes — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas encore pu confirmer votre achat. Si vous avez terminé le paiement, votre plan sera mis à jour automatiquement dans quelques minutes — inutile d'acheter à nouveau."

#. Error dialog body when the server's verify answer for a Play purchase is terminal `invalid` — the proof will never verify (unknown token, disallowed product, canceled before completing). The purchase is still acknowledged with Play so a real charge is not auto-refunded; this dialog is how the failure reaches the user instead of a silent nothing (android google/PlanViewModel.kt report path).
msgctxt "purchase_could_not_be_verified"
msgid "This purchase could not be verified with Google Play, so it can't be applied to your account. If you were charged and your plan doesn't update, please contact support."
msgstr "Cet achat n’a pas pu être vérifié auprès de Google Play, il ne peut donc pas être appliqué à votre compte. Si vous avez été débité et que votre forfait ne se met pas à jour, contactez l’assistance."

#. Restore-purchases outcome: an entitlement for the current network was found; the confirmation poll now bridges the gap until the server credits it (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift).
msgctxt "purchase_found_confirming_your_plan"
msgid "Purchase found. Confirming your plan — it will update automatically."
msgstr "Achat trouvé. Confirmation de votre forfait — il se mettra à jour automatiquement."

#. Upgrade: the overlay shown while a store purchase waits for approval. Keep UR Pro (the plan's name) unchanged.
msgctxt "purchase_pending_body"
msgid "Your purchase is waiting for approval. UR Pro will turn on by itself once it goes through — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "Votre achat est en attente d’approbation. UR Pro s’activera tout seul dès qu’il sera validé — inutile d’acheter à nouveau."

#. Upgrade: the heading of the overlay shown while a store purchase waits for approval (for example a parent's).
msgctxt "purchase_pending_title"
msgid "Almost there."
msgstr "Presque terminé."

